        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "White Linen is the latest high-quality development delivered by Faughnan Construction comprising a mix of stylish and modern 2 and 3 bed mid and end terrace homes in Co. Longford. \r\nStep inside and discover homes thoughtfully designed to combine modern style, exceptional quality, and everyday comfort. Each residence showcases superior craftsmanship, contemporary kitchens, and carefully considered layouts that create bright, functional living spaces for modern family life.\r\nBuilt to the latest building standards, these A-rated homes incorporate innovative, energy-efficient technology, including air-to-water heat pump systems, delivering year-round comfort, healthier indoor air quality, lower energy consumption, and reduced running costs. Designed with sustainability at their core, these homes offer the perfect balance of quality crafted, efficiency, and future-proof living.\r\nAccommodation\r\nEntrance hallway 1.97m x 5.69m\r\nLiving room 3.93m x 4.86m\r\nKitchen 3.41m x 3.77m\r\nDining area 3.41m x 3.77m\r\nUtility 2.23m x 1.4m\r\nW.C. 1.52m x 1.4m\r\nBedroom 1 3.32m x 5.84m\r\nBedroom 2 3.32m x 4.33m\r\nBedroom 3 2.58m x 3.06m\r\nBathroom 2.58m x 2.7m \r\nStorage 1.04m x 1.72m\r\nThis home will qualify for the Help to Buy scheme which helps first-time buyers purchase a newly built house or apartment. For more information and to register your interest, please contact James L. Murtagh Auctioneers\r\nThe developers, Faughnan Construction, specialise in creating unique and exclusive properties. Their work is a source of inspiration, and it is evident in their quality of workmanship. Faughnan Construction take pride in providing exceptional quality and design in their homes and have a proven record with delivering a premium product featuring top-tier specifications and design.\r\nIdeally just off the N4, just minutes from Longford Town Centre, this exciting new development enjoys a prime setting opposite the N4 Axis Centre. The location offers the perfect balance of convenience and connectivity, with immediate access to a wide range of shops, schools, sporting facilities, healthcare services, and everyday amenities.\r\nExcellent transport links, including the nearby N4 national route and Longford Railway Station, provide easy access to Dublin, Sligo, and the wider Midlands region, making it an ideal choice for commuters and families alike.\r\nSet within an established and thriving residential area, the development benefits from a mature setting, strong local infrastructure, and ongoing investment in the surrounding area, creating an attractive place to live and grow."
      },
